  PROOF: tests/test_clearhold.py (14 checks, new, wired into run_all.sh) drives the REAL script in a
  subprocess through every clear-hold branch — held, empty, unreadable, and the release request —
  because the defect lived in shell quoting and only the shell reproduces it. Whole suite ALL GREEN.
